  "content": "# 第25题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\nAfter talking with Professor Devon, the author decided to ________.\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. criticise the review process\n\nB. B. stay longer in the Sahara Desert\n\nC. C. apply to the original project again\n\nD. D. put his heart and soul into the lab work\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nD\n\n",
  "answer": "B",
  "analysis": "本题考查连词辨析。A. 虽然；B. 除非；C. 因为；D. 以便。句意‘除非你努力学习，否则你不会通过考试’，故选B。"
